My thoughts exactly. How can they sell something like this, when it plain and simple just doesn't work. In my case, shortened shocks, bolted-thru metal P-Plates, Frog shafts, O-rings and new trailing arms every couple of runs weren't enough to solve the issue. I'm running vintage Thorp[ telesc]opic shafts now.
